sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant App as Existing Flutter app
    participant API as Local FastAPI
    participant Model as CPU Qwen model
    participant DB as SQLite
    Student->>App: Choose document
    App->>API: POST /documents (file)
    alt Scanned PDF
        API-->>App: Unsupported scanned PDF error
    else Selectable PDF / Word / TXT
        API->>API: Extract text
    end
    API->>DB: Save source and review requirement
    API-->>App: document_id, text, page information
    Student->>App: Correct and confirm text
    App->>API: POST /documents/review (document_id, text)
    API->>DB: Save new reviewed document
    API-->>App: New document_id
    App->>API: POST /quizzes (document_id, count, difficulty)
    loop One batch, at most one retry
        API->>Model: Numbered source sentences and compact batch instructions
        Model-->>API: Questions, answers, alternatives and source indexes
        API->>API: Attach original quotes and validate answers
    end
    API->>DB: Save quiz and answer key
    API-->>App: Questions and options (no answers)
    Student->>App: Select answers and submit
    App->>API: POST /quizzes/id/submit (answers)
    API->>DB: Load answer key and save first result
    API-->>App: Score, grade, review and recommendations
    App->>API: GET /history
    API-->>App: Completed results
